- WHAT'S WRONG,
CAPTAIN FROSTYMUG?
- 怎么了，
弗罗斯蒂马克船长？

10:13.233 --> 10:17.567
- I HAVEN'T TOUCHED
A MILKSHAKE MACHINE IN 20 YEARS.
- 我还没碰过
20 年来的奶昔机。

10:17.567 --> 10:19.267
DEAR NEPTUNE'S THUNDERCLAP!
亲爱的海王星的雷霆！

10:19.267 --> 10:21.067
I'M STUCK IN THE BLENDER!
我被困在搅拌机里了！

10:21.067 --> 10:22.733
HELP!
帮助！

10:22.733 --> 10:24.233
- CAPTAIN FROSTYMUG!
- 弗罗斯蒂马克船长！

10:24.233 --> 10:27.433
- OH! MY ARM!
AAH!
- 哦！我的手臂！
啊啊！

10:27.433 --> 10:28.900
- DON'T WORRY, SIR,
I'M COMING.
- 别担心，先生，
我来了。

10:28.900 --> 10:30.833
I GOT YA, CAPTAIN.
[grunts]
我明白了，队长。
[咕哝]

10:30.833 --> 10:32.267
- SAVE YOURSELF, BOY.
- 救救你自己吧，孩子。

10:32.267 --> 10:34.267
I'M A GONER.
- NO!
我已经死了。
- 不！

10:34.267 --> 10:38.000
I'M NOT LEAVING YOU BEHIND.
我不会丢下你的。

10:38.000 --> 10:40.233
[metal clanking]
[金属叮当作响]

10:42.033 --> 10:44.400
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:45.800 --> 10:48.933
- THANKS, SPONGEBOB.
[coughs]
- 谢谢，海绵宝宝。
[咳嗽]

10:48.933 --> 10:51.467
YOU KNOW, NO ONE'S EVER
TREATED THIS OLD CAPTAIN
你知道，没有人曾经
对待这位老船长

10:51.467 --> 10:52.800
WITH MUCH KINDNESS.
充满善意。

10:52.800 --> 10:56.567
AND IN RETURN, I'D LIKE
TO TELL YOU A LITTLE SECRET.
作为回报，我愿意
告诉你一个小秘密。

10:56.567 --> 10:59.167
ALL THESE YEARS, I'VE BEEN
ABLE TO MAKE MILKSHAKES
这些年来，我一直
能够制作奶昔

10:59.167 --> 11:02.600
WITHOUT A MACHINE
BECAUSE MAKING MILKSHAKES
没有机器
因为制作奶昔

11:02.600 --> 11:05.333
REALLY COMES
FROM WITHIN.
真的来了
从内部。

11:05.333 --> 11:07.500
DOES THAT MAKE SENSE?
这有道理吗？

11:07.500 --> 11:11.067
- NOT AT ALL.
- 一点也不。

11:11.067 --> 11:14.933
ONE MILKSHAKE,
COMING RIGHT UP.
一杯奶昔，
马上就来。

11:25.867 --> 11:27.800
- YOU'VE REDEEMED YOURSELF,
SPONGEBOB.
- 你已经救赎了自己，
海绵宝宝。

11:27.800 --> 11:30.900
THIS IS THE BEST MILKSHAKE
I'VE EVER HAD.
这是最好的奶昔
我曾经有过。

11:30.900 --> 11:33.233
- YO, I WANT ONE TOO!
- 哟，我也想要一个！

11:33.233 --> 11:35.700
- WHERE'D YOU LEARN
THOSE MOVES, SPONGEBOB?
- 你在哪里学的
那些动作，海绵宝宝？

11:35.700 --> 11:37.067
- THAT WOULD BE FROM ME.
- 那是我说的。

11:37.067 --> 11:39.400
AND IN LIGHT OF RECENT EVENTS,
SPONGEBOB,
鉴于最近发生的事件，
海绵宝宝，

11:39.400 --> 11:42.167
I'D LIKE TO GIVE YOU THIS.
我想给你这个。

11:42.167 --> 11:44.833
- [gasps]
MY MILKSHAKE LICENSE!
- [喘气]
我的奶昔许可证！

11:44.833 --> 11:46.833
[sniffling]
IF ONLY IT WERE THIS EASY
[抽鼻子]
要是这么简单就好了

11:46.833 --> 11:49.767
TO GET A VOTING LICENSE.
[laughs]
获得投票许可证。
[笑]

11:52.700 --> 11:55.700
[lilting ukelele music]
[轻快的尤克里里音乐]

[轻快的尤克里里音乐]